title: Vowel counter
golf: 58

Write `count_vowels(text)` that counts the vowels (a, e, i, o, u) in some text.
Capital letters count too: `count_vowels("Apple")` gives `2`.
=== starter
def count_vowels(text):
    ...
=== broken
def count_vowels(text):
    count = 0
    for ch in text.lower():
        if ch in "aeiou":
            count += 1
        return count
=== test
from harness import eq


def test_count_vowels(sol):
    eq(sol.count_vowels("banana"), 3, 'count_vowels("banana")')
    eq(sol.count_vowels("Apple"), 2, 'count_vowels("Apple")')
    eq(sol.count_vowels("rhythm"), 0, 'count_vowels("rhythm")')
